{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, approach, take, process and check the object. If obstacle, avoid, move or scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = Move    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
